{"abstract":[{"text":"Alert message is a UI element that displays system feedback, status changes or required action; throughout detailed, prominent, persistent and actionable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"communication. Alert message includes functional icon and semantic colour, and may include as well a close button and\/or action link.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Alert Message does not disappear automatically and remains visible until dismissed or resolved by the user.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/Link"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-1p0x5","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-1uwaa","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-3cyay","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-8hxrc","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/init(label:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-3cw9f","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/init(label:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-69guh","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/init(label:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-8ddeg","doc:\/\/OUDSC